<!--ID=5B95B1CC-2C7B-494F-B746-CF22A0E779B7;Version=1|{"Locales":{"en-US":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]},"en-GB":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]}}}-->
<speak xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis"
       xmlns:mstts="http://www.w3.org/2001/mstts"
       xmlns:emo="http://www.w3.org/2009/10/emotionml"
       version="1.0"
       xml:lang="en-GB">
  <voice name="en-GB-OllieMultilingualNeural">
    <prosody rate="-13.00%" pitch="-3.40%">
      The bread came each morning.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Enough for the day.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Nothing wasted.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Nothing lacking.<break time="1800ms"/>

      God's provision was faithful.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Not rushed.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Not withheld.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Given in the exact measure of the need.<break time="1800ms"/>

      You do not have to carry tomorrow's portion tonight.<break time="1800ms"/>
      You do not have to gather what has not yet been given.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Today's grace is enough.<break time="3800ms"/>

      The wilderness was wide and the people were many.<break time="1800ms"/>
      But every morning, the ground was covered.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Every morning, the bread was there.<break time="1800ms"/>
      Every morning, God had already been at work before they opened their eyes.<break time="3800ms"/>

      His faithfulness is not a single sunrise.<break time="1800ms"/>
      It is forty years of sunrises.<break time="1800ms"/>
      It is bread on the ground before the first footstep.<break time="1800ms"/>
      It is provision that arrives ahead of panic.<break time="3800ms"/>

      You are not forgotten in the wilderness of this night.<break time="1800ms"/>
      You are not left without what you need.<break time="1800ms"/>
      The bread is given.<break time="1800ms"/>
      You are provided for.<break time="3800ms"/>
      You can rest.<break time="3800ms"/>
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
